   "slug": "speech-824921",
   "speaker": "Jacinta Collins",
   "party": "Labor",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2013-06-24",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The bills amend tax laws to tax excess concessional superannuation contributions at an individual's marginal rate instead of the top 46.5% rate, allow withdrawal of excess contributions, and apply from 1 July 2013; the change is estimated to reduce tax liability for about 40,000 low and middle income earners by around $1,100 on average in 2013-14."
  }
